      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "STRING",
          "type": "STRING",
          "links": [
            4
          ]
        }
      ],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Photograph of a tangible full-size robotic vehicle, not a miniature. Restrained saturation, natural tonal transitions, fine material texture. Matte painted panels, subdued brushed-metal reflections, small dark sensor lenses. A few recessed fasteners, narrow panel seams and protected pivots at plausible scale. Every instrument is securely mounted; each arm has one continuous chain of connected joints. Suspension and propulsion have clearance to move. Sealed opaque equipment housings, no cabin or passenger windows. Preserve silhouette, equipment placement and propulsion type. No glossy toy finish, theatrical bloom, captions or graphic overlays.\n\nEngineering reference photograph on a seamless neutral WHITE floor and WHITE background. Soft broad light from above-left, gentle fill, faint contact shadow. Expose white body panels slightly darker than the backdrop so edges remain visible. Entire vehicle with clear margin, sharp focus across the body, moderate perspective like a 70mm lens. Clean baseline manufactured surfaces with subtle machining marks. No scenery, rocks, red dust, display pedestal or green reflections."
      ]
    },
